message: "If you use this software or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "OTP Guard: a layered SMS validation, risk-scoring and rate-limiting pipeline against OTP flood abuse"
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: NOASSERTION
repository-code: "https://github.com/nahmedpsu/OTP-DDOS"
authors:
  - name: "nahmedpsu (GitHub)"   # TODO: replace with the author's full name and ORCID before archiving
keywords:
  - OTP
  - SMS pumping
  - artificially inflated traffic
  - rate limiting
  - fraud prevention
abstract: >
  Design, implementation and simulated evaluation of a twelve-step pipeline that protects an
  SMS one-time-password endpoint against flood and pumping abuse, with a verification feedback
  loop, a risk score engine, adaptive limits and a global circuit breaker. Includes a log-replay
  tool, a load test, and a calibrated multi-seed evaluation with confidence intervals.
